Zig for Debian
==============

See <https://ziglang.org/documentation/> for documentation. The language
reference for the packaged version is installed as
/usr/share/doc/zig/langref.html.

The compiler is installed to /usr/lib/zig/zig, with its standard library in
/usr/lib/zig/lib; /usr/bin/zig is a symlink to it.

Use <https://codeberg.org/ziglang/zig/issues> for bug reports regarding Zig.

Use <https://github.com/dryzig/zig-debian/issues> for bug reports and
feature requests regarding the packaging of Zig for Debian.
